<title>INDONESIA: MOTOCROSS-ITALY'S CHIODI WINS 125CC IN INDONESIA.</title>
<headline>MOTOCROSS-ITALY'S CHIODI WINS 125CC IN INDONESIA.</headline>
<dateline>YOGYAKARTA, Indonesia 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on Sunday</p>
<p>in the opening round of the 1997 world 125cc motocross</p>
<p>championship</p>
<p>1. Alessio Chiodi (Italy) Yamaha 40 points (two-race</p>
<p>time:one hour 32 minutes 23.03)</p>
<p>2. Bob Moore (U.S.) Yamaha 26</p>
<p>3. Allesandro Puzar (Italy) TM 25</p>
<p>4. Xavier Colomer (Spain)   TM 25</p>
</text>
